v0.3.0
-------
-Included support for depth filtering and handling of ERI mesh elements below EMI model DOI in EM2ER workflow.
-Optimization improvements for mapXY function in DataMapper.

v0.2.0
-------
-Files for the three classes included in previous update were of an older version with some (but not all) bug fixes and new functions. Correct files for each class are now included.
-Enough new functions and stability fixes have been added to warrant moving to v0.2.0.

v0.1.3
-------
-Fixed errors with 'num' ckdMethod in DataMapper
-Added spatial interpolation confidence report functions in DataMapper and linked functions in EM2ER and VSE to these functions
-Added ground-truth comparison plots to VSE
-Updated Jupyter Notebooks and input files for all four examples

v0.1.2
-------
-Updated dependencies list in pyproject.toml to fix some dependencies not being included in pip install

v0.1.1
------
-Update GitHub repo structure for easier installation

v0.1.0
-------
-First release beta version providing resistivity to EM, EM to resistivity, and visualization/statistical analysis workflows
